  "id": "8v8-kickoff-left",
  "title": "8v8 Kickoff — Release the Left Mid",
  "description": "From a 2-1-2-1-1: the striker passes back as the CAM moves left. The left mid bursts from halfway; the CAM passes into the run and the team moves up and across.",
  "tags": [
    "8v8",
    "kickoff",
